..!interpreter english translate noabbrev
..*****************************************************************************
.. Name           : CREDITNOTE.LINES
.. Author         : mh
.. Verantwortlich : mh
.. Kontrolle      : 
.. Functionality  : Processes one credit note item [1 row in infosystem ]at a time 
...Includes       :
..  include  dfue/CREDITNOTE.FIND.DELIVERY
..  include  dfue/CREDITNOTE.FIND.INVOICE
..  include  dfue/CREDITNOTE.FIND.ORDER
..  include  dfue/CREDITNOTE.DO.RELEASE
..*****************************************************************************
..!meta M|=dfue/CREDITNOTE
.set trans -
..
.. Add general creditnote data to each item
.copy M|tganr = M|kganr
.copy M|tgadat = M|kgadat
.copy M|tgaschl = M|kgaschl
.copy M|tgafdat = M|kgafdat
.copy M|tgaabschlussnr = M|kabschlussnr
.. 
.. 
.. Find matching information for each credit note item in abas erp
.input "CREDITNOTE.FIND.DELIVERY"
.input "CREDITNOTE.FIND.INVOICE"
.input "CREDITNOTE.FIND.ORDER"
..
.. 
.. Which item might be use to create an invoice item?
.. + delivery -> invoice?
.. + sales order item -> invoice?
.copy M|tbeleg = M|tlieferposition    ?  M|tlifakt & _F|empty(M|tlieferposition)
.copy M|tbeleg = M|tauftragsposition  ? _M|tlifakt & _F|empty(M|tauftragsposition)
.copy M|tbelegmoeglich = G|true ? _F|empty(M|tbeleg) & M|tlirerelev & _M|tliumlagerung & _M|tlistorniert & _M|tlieferschein^uebertr
.copy M|tbelegmoeglich = G|false ? _F|empty(M|treposition)
.. 
.. 
.. Check if credit note item can be "released" 
.input "CREDITNOTE.DO.RELEASE"
.. 
..*****************************************************************************
!END
.continue
